    "body": "claimed: M5 (mkinney fork, issue-worker-low) · 2026-11-13T15:47Z · branch mkinney:issue/1428-app-icon · plan: the cause is #1179 (6792a8a3), which deleted `assets/ui/cube.png` as an unused UI glyph while 5 packaging scripts (linux, macos, appimage, flatpak, snap) still install it as the app icon. Fix: a dedicated `assets/ui/app-icon.png` (the restored cube image, with its LICENSES.md row), all 5 scripts pointed at it, and an xtask unit test that fails when a path a `scripts/package-*.sh` installs is missing from the tree. Whether 0.19.0 gets its Linux/macOS packages stays the maintainer's call.",
