    "updated_at": "2026-11-13T19:04:36Z",
    "body": "v0.19.0's missing Linux and macOS packages are now attached to the release (maintainer OK, relayed by the user).\n\n**Built from:** the `v0.19.0` tag (a2b357b4) plus only `assets/ui/cube.png` from main 936172d8 (#1430), which is byte-identical to v0.18.0's (sha256 4c6d57ca…). No other file differs from the tag.\n\n**Built on our own machines, not CI, following release.yml's own job steps and checks:**\n- **Linux:** in an `ubuntu:22.04` container (the CI runner's OS; glibc 2.35).\n- **macOS:** universal (arm64 + x86_64), ad-hoc signed exactly like CI (no notarization, as in CI).\n\n| file | sha256 |\n|---|---|\n| camcraft-0.19.0-linux-x86_64.AppImage | 303d85b60db9d2d268f05bba27fdcc5efbed2135c1a3eed13e22dfc4b4da93d1 |\n| camcraft-0.19.0-linux-x86_64.deb | ff0c305368ff5f272b28211318a9ae1a7ffc273bd3210e3e721d6c80d50b41b6 |\n| camcraft-0.19.0-linux-x86_64.rpm | b9312dda7824f96dcb270df7e11fe61e24b880857cb32542da52d9598904e373 |\n| camcraft-0.19.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz | 3459c56e3daca1cac9424619852e06c446fe59d01917d56b1517c295f2886cae |\n| camcraft-0.19.0-macos-universal.dmg | bfd39673dd74a68548e64bd734c5323c59c0cde6b95d86d9c8b3c338f93b1102 |\n| camcraft-0.19.0-macos-universal.zip | bb9632cb263e803692a1bbe3e4785c0e63c9a8004eb90f5d0e7e145bb40d95e7 |\n\n**Not built:** Snap, Flatpak and AUR. Snap and Flatpak need tooling a plain container lacks, and AUR builds from the tag tarball, which lacks the icon. They return with the next cut.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
